  "translation": "Salutations to the <b>fierce one</b>, to the <b>eternal one</b>, to <b>Gaurī</b>, to the <b>supporter</b> of all. Salutations always to her who is <b>moonlight</b>, who has the form of the <b>moon</b>, who is <b>happiness</b> itself.",
  "translation_hi": "रौद्रा को, नित्या को, गौरी को, धात्री को बार बार नमस्कार है। ज्योत्स्ना को, चंद्ररूपिणी को और सुखस्वरूपा को सदा नमस्कार है।",
